## reward.soar -- agent-world: 1 elaboration.

## Elaborate state reward -> sets reward.
## reward
## Created 2024/01/13
sp {agent-world*elaborate*state*reward
   :default
   (state <s>
               ^flags.rl true
               ^desireds <desireds>
               ^reward-link <r>
               ^success <desireds>)
-->
   (<r> ^reward.value 1.0)}
